<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Village in animation joint venture.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Village in animation joint venture.</headline>
<dateline>BRISBANE 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Village Roadshow Ltd said on Monday it had taken a 50 percent stake in Australian animation studio Yoram Gross Film Studios Pty Ltd for an undisclosed sum.</p>
<p>Village said Yoram Gross has produced several award-winning animation titles including the Blinky Bill feature and television series, which is based on an Australian children's book.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
